essage\">One of my favorite fan games is going to be updated, well, I'm happy. As a graphic designer I would love to be part of the project in a graphic way, I'm not a very good artist, but I can work my way around editing and doing layout and creating a pleasing pdf.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you want to be part of the project, then submit the necessary post as detailed on the first page.<br /> <br /> Edit: Apologies if that sounded rude. It\u2019s just that the necessary \u2018paperwork\u2019 is all available on the first page of this thread, and I was only trying to help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 07-18-2020, 08:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-29T17:41:20-07:00","id":1446533,"title":"","content":"Oh, hey! You guys are still alive! I thought for certain this project was deader than dead.<br /> I've actually been using the origional version and the Rekindled draft as a pair to play Dragon: the Embers with my own Chronicles of Darkness group? I was this close to synthesizing my own version from that alone.<br /> <br /> Have you guys considered getting a Discord for this project?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25003-witchling","name":"Witchling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpat